  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The Fedora repository can act like a registry of services ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "via BDef objects. This could be done by having the ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "BDef objects contain a datastream that is WSDL that ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "binds to a Fedora repository as the proxy for end-point ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "service. When Fedora repositories are federated, this ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "can act like a UDDI repository, but maybe simpler.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Date: 2005-03-24 11:31",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sender: payette",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Logged In: YES ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "user_id=128",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Clever notion to have BDef's with fedora dissemination ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "bindings (template with pids as variable).  Look at this ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "in context of federation or dynamic disseminations.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Date: 2004-09-07 11:36",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sender: payette",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Logged In: YES ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "user_id=128",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Also, can we implement a UDDI 2.0 interface over Fedora to ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "make it work as if it were a UDDI registry?",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
